"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Dubai’s heat\"},{\"_key\":\"6a284cf37388\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" or \"},{\"_key\":\"4001043eba84\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Abu Dhabi’s humidity\"},{\"_key\":\"020686616ff0\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" is a challenge. As we head into \"},{\"_key\":\"334ed9a9b933\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"2026\"},{\"_key\":\"d70470900890\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\", you need a shaver that cuts close without irritating \"},{\"_key\":\"2bc4cb74c214\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"sensitive skin\"},{\"_key\":\"9d7285caad62\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\". We spent hours analysing real user reviews on Amazon.ae to find the electric razors that actually handle thick Middle Eastern stubble.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"bc13dfd5eb57\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"8c6b30c75060\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"While an electric shaver is perfect for a smooth, clean finish, it isn't designed for maintaining stubble or beard styles. If you're looking to shape and trim facial hair instead, check out our guide to the \"},{\"_key\":\"4c3a06321547\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\",\"92730653fd88\"],\"text\":\"Best Beard Trimmer in UAE 2026\"}],\"markDefs\":[{\"_key\":\"92730653fd88\",\"_type\":\"link\",\"href\":\"https://toptenuae.com/top-ten/best-beard-trimmers-uae/\"}],\"style\":\"normal\"}],\"closingContent\":[{\"_key\":\"34ee58bc46b6\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"9d66dd894843\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"How We Selected the Best Electric Shavers for the UAE (2026 Standards)\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"h2\"},{\"_key\":\"59c26c49d48e\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"3fe33fd2144b\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"To ensure this list is practical for men living in Dubai, Abu Dhabi, and the Northern Emirates, we didn't just look at global specs. We evaluated these shavers based on \"},{\"_key\":\"62df91abee3b\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"five critical criteria\"},{\"_key\":\"5fdfb38c3867\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" relevant to our region:\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"5e3524cc4809\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"510dce8204f4\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Performance in High Humidity:\"},{\"_key\":\"a072342e3c64\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" We prioritized shavers that glide smoothly even when skin is slightly damp or sweaty—a common issue in the UAE summer.\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"d1c1bbf034a3\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"82c670937a4e\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Motor Torque vs. Coarse Hair:\"},{\"_key\":\"c1dd0cfea88b\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" Middle Eastern beard hair tends to be thicker and coarser. We selected models with high-speed motors (CPM) that cut without pulling or tugging.\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"fa266b2447a3\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"f36fbdb1c1d9\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Hygiene & Maintenance:\"},{\"_key\":\"71283c67032a\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" Preference was given to \"},{\"_key\":\"24a829d28294\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"100% waterproof\"},{\"_key\":\"3b3bbbbca280\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" models that are easy to rinse, preventing bacteria buildup caused by heat and humidity.\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"a880107e0628\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"9584adcf36e3\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Real User Feedback:\"},{\"_key\":\"5e74f15160bc\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" We analyzed verified purchase reviews from \"},{\"_key\":\"7239403c0f6b\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Amazon.ae\"},{\"_key\":\"0854c882c059\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" and \"},{\"_key\":\"0599b21dc42b\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Noon\"},{\"_key\":\"ab33c699a644\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" to filter out global hype and focus on local durability experiences.\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"c5937d2c87bc\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"c95f443b8ead\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Value for Money (2026):\"},{\"_key\":\"9328cda31afa\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" We assessed whether the price (in AED) matches the performance, warranty coverage, and spare part availability in local markets.\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"62959e378a44\",\"_type\":\"separator\",\"style\":\"line\"},{\"_key\":\"8b3eaf06138f\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"889d3428cb79\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Foil vs. Rotary Shavers: Which is Best for You?\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"h2\"},{\"_key\":\"7bb2b83a99c7\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"8a0ea2a042bc\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"If you are unsure which type to buy, here is a breakdown based on our 2026 testing results.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"6bf5a1956aee\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"8f04f958cf60\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Foil vs. Rotary: The Mechanics\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"276512bcba27\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"cf94b3cd3513\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Foil Shavers (e.g., Braun):\"},{\"_key\":\"6b5015756802\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" Use oscillating blades that move back and forth behind a thin metal screen. They cut like a pair of scissors—precise and close.\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"297d36969e1e\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"0a7dd9608c2c\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Rotary Shavers (e.g., Philips):\"},{\"_key\":\"32e31c85552e\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" Use circular blades that spin behind a guard. They lift and cut hair from multiple angles, making them better for irregular growth patterns.\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"e8a8b4cd7a57\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"d45ff6ff2a04\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"85938dcf0025\",\"_type\":\"table\",\"rows\":[{\"_key\":\"43ed3879-8ce4-4144-a869-c7680dc17f7b\",\"_type\":\"tableRow\",\"cells\":[\" Feature\",\"Foil Shavers (e.g., Braun, Panasonic)\",\"Rotary Shavers (e.g., Philips Norelco)\"]},{\"_key\":\"b11618d7-defe-4c4b-aa37-f52aed370523\",\"_type\":\"tableRow\",\"cells\":[\"Best For\",\"Sensitive skin, precision, and very close shaves.\",\"Thick, coarse, curly beards, and tough contours (neck/jaw).\"]},{\"_key\":\"f1757d48-9af3-466a-bafb-23199e711e9d\",\"_type\":\"tableRow\",\"cells\":[\"Shaving Motion\",\"Straight Lines Only (Up and Down).\",\"Circular Motions (Small circles).\"]},{\"_key\":\"6c3ee4b5-7b3b-447d-b493-6f125ceda8bd\",\"_type\":\"tableRow\",\"cells\":[\"Feel on Skin\",\"Crisp and close. Can get warm during long sessions.\",\"Smooth glide. \\\"Floating\\\" heads adapt to bone structure.\"]},{\"_key\":\"2a07db1e-1fab-4eb6-8067-1457b209644b\",\"_type\":\"tableRow\",\"cells\":[\"Stubble Handling\",\"Best for daily shaving (1-3 days growth).\",\"Handles longer growth easily (3-7 days).\"]},{\"_key\":\"d6a262c3-a28a-4dca-bbe1-3af229becfce\",\"_type\":\"tableRow\",\"cells\":[\"Our 2026 Take\",\"Choose Foil if you prioritize a \\\"baby smooth\\\" finish and shave daily.\",\"Choose Rotary if you have a thick Dubai beard and want a fast, comfortable morning shave.\"]}]},{\"_key\":\"b72de7d3fb56\",\"_type\":\"separator\",\"style\":\"line\"},{\"_key\":\"14cc5749d0e9\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"95bf08222f0c\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"How to Choose: Your 2026 Buying Guide for the UAE\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"h2\"},{\"_key\":\"4eb071650f95\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"318c0c0503a5\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Buying an electric shaver is an investment. Before you checkout on Amazon or Noon, consider these three factors to ensure you get the right tool for your face.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"78bbc11f24ff\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"2d95b06b890e\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"1. Understanding Your Skin Type & Beard Growth\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"h3\"},{\"_key\":\"bb96538998ed\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"4373cbcf18ac\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"For Sensitive Skin:\"},{\"_key\":\"d15822c67056\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" If you get razor burn easily, look for \"},{\"_key\":\"b47bd937cb39\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"hypoallergenic foils\"},{\"_key\":\"1b2960c2ef59\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" (standard on Braun models) or \"},{\"_key\":\"fb41d7bf29d2\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"ComfortGlide rings\"},{\"_key\":\"3af3934670a4\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" (Philips). Always test a new shaver on a dry face first, as wet shaving with hot water can sometimes increase sensitivity.\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"b239aca3a32b\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"6bfaa096758e\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"For Very Thick Beards:\"},{\"_key\":\"b6f8c70dc07d\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" You need power, not just sharp blades. Prioritize shavers with \"},{\"_key\":\"4bf94fd9156e\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"high-torque motors\"},{\"_key\":\"b7c4388fd117\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" or \\\"AutoSense\\\" technology that reads beard density. A weak motor will pull the hair rather than cut it.\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"c4f946de81fa\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"7965806bfa40\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"2. The \\\"UAE Climate\\\" Factor\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"h3\"},{\"_key\":\"9e3be89c5fd3\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"9223dc42df9c\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Waterproofing is Non-Negotiable:\"},{\"_key\":\"74ffab20109d\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" In hot and humid weather, \\\"wet shaving\\\" (using gel or foam) is often more comfortable than dry shaving. Ensure your chosen model is \"},{\"_key\":\"23263c704bfb\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"IPX7 waterproof\"},{\"_key\":\"fa4e92f51481\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" so you can use it in the shower or rinse it thoroughly to prevent bacterial rash.\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"95a4731c3059\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"adc14c86862b\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Anti-Corrosion:\"},{\"_key\":\"829d5ea96c32\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" High humidity can rust cheaper blades. Stick to reputable brands like Panasonic (stainless steel) or Philips (self-sharpening steel), which resist corrosion better than generic alternatives.\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"6bf1b6050ac3\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"c1bb606af055\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"3. Travel & Charging Features\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"h3\"},{\"_key\":\"2a263148c25b\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"30f71a8595ac\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Universal Voltage:\"},{\"_key\":\"0b0f5fb89ac3\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" Most modern shavers support 100-240V, but always double-check. This ensures you can use your shaver in Europe, the US, or Asia without a transformer.\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"c678545524ae\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"f64f5e2a1b88\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"USB-C Charging:\"},{\"_key\":\"d931daa8e31e\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" For 2026, look for models that charge via USB-C. This reduces cable clutter in your travel bag, allowing you to charge your shaver with your phone charger.\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"}],\"faqs\":[{\"_key\":\"dc76bd95c4d7\",\"answer\":[{\"_key\":\"2ca8de671321\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"da2ddf0a257d\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"For sensitive skin, we recommend the \"},{\"_key\":\"97948e5e8fd3\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Philips Norelco i9000 Prestige\"},{\"_key\":\"8099a60c820d\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\". It features a unique \"},{\"_key\":\"49e3c53a7469\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"\\\"Pressure Guard\\\" sensor\"},{\"_key\":\"89a2a84751a8\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" that changes color if you press too hard, preventing razor burn before it happens. This is especially important in the UAE's humid climate, where sweat can make skin \\\"sticky\\\" and more prone to irritation from friction.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"}],\"question\":\"Which electric shaver is best for sensitive skin in UAE?\"},{\"_key\":\"b77fc03978d3\",\"answer\":[{\"_key\":\"b99eb1bebeaf\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"463d4c551e5f\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Yes, premium foil shavers like the \"},{\"_key\":\"31c8620c37c9\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Braun Series 9 Pro+\"},{\"_key\":\"a4b13892dd84\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" can cut hair down to \"},{\"_key\":\"545a4fd25f90\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"0.05mm\"},{\"_key\":\"4103452e5a2e\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\", which is virtually identical to a manual razor. Unlike rotary shavers, foil heads allow you to get extremely close to the skin without lifting or pulling the hair, ensuring a smooth finish.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"}],\"question\":\"Can an electric shaver give a close shave like a razor blade?\"},{\"_key\":\"9887dbeb4efd\",\"answer\":[{\"_key\":\"2e689ad4efae\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"cbff6c751cb6\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"You can find reliable budget shavers like the \"},{\"_key\":\"9ddd3456a596\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Wahl Travel Shaver\"},{\"_key\":\"c91bf03fe7ac\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" for around \"},{\"_key\":\"d701f8a5f802\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"AED 75\"},{\"_key\":\"90c3dd626988\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\". However, for daily use with advanced features (wet/dry use, self-cleaning stations), expect to pay between \"},{\"_key\":\"387e5f4f1a32\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"AED 800 and AED 1,500\"},{\"_key\":\"e034695a992b\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\".\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"}],\"question\":\"How much does a good electric shaver cost in Dubai?\"},{\"