\"],\"text\":\"best electric shaver for men\"},{\"_key\":\"86f3edd2880b\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" in the UAE market. Its foil cutter head gets as close as 0.05mm, making it superior to most rotary shavers for a clean, smooth finish.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"}],\"question\":\"Which is the best electric shaver for a close shave for men?\"},{\"_key\":\"99c04e81fddb\",\"answer\":[{\"_key\":\"79997f742ae3\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"7a314f704cc7\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"If you need the \"},{\"_key\":\"65c7d76a0fd9\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"best electric shaver for sensitive skin\"},{\"_key\":\"63ffb80f759f\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\", we recommend the \"},{\"_key\":\"e1176914a0c8\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Philips Norelco Series\"},{\"_key\":\"02e999e0827b\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" (Rotary) or the \"},{\"_key\":\"e1747d715d1d\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Panasonic Arc 5\"},{\"_key\":\"d30a6d0b080e\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\". For \"},{\"_key\":\"3a633c99d00d\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"sensitive areas\"},{\"_key\":\"6b976e20de8e\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" (body grooming), look for shavers with specific \\\"skin-guard\\\" attachments to prevent nicks and irritation.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"}],\"question\":\"What is the best shaving machine for sensitive skin and sensitive areas?\"}],\"intro\":\"Updated for 2026, this expert-curated guide ranks the best electric shavers in the UAE for close, comfortable shaving — tested for Dubai’s heat, humidity, and sensitive skin needs.\",\"listItems\":[{\"_key\":\"c5d48c76ffbc\",\"badgeLabel\":\"Best electric shaver for close shave\",\"customVerdict\":null,\"product\":{\"_type\":\"product\",\"address\":null,\"affiliateLink\":\"https://amzn.to/48YdeXQ\",\"availability\":\"https://schema.org/InStock\",\"brand\":\"Braun\",\"code\":null,\"cons\":[\"Very high price point\",\"Bulky for light travel\"],\"country\":null,\"currency\":\"AED\",\"curriculum\":null,\"customerRating\":4.3,\"entityType\":null,\"feeRange\":null,\"heroFeature\":null,\"keyFeatures\":[\"6-in-1 SmartCare Center\",\"ProLift Trimmer for long hair\",\"100% Waterproof\",\"60 min battery + PowerCase\"],\"location\":null,\"mainImage\":{\"alt\":\"Braun Series 9 PRO+ electric shaver with cleaning station 2026 model\",\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/kxdjzy8e/production/02c369f975365dda23aa46224c921b9c13ab7616-1500x1403.jpg\"},\"price\":1194,\"priceTier\":\"Premium\",\"pros\":[\"Zero irritation on sensitive skin\",\"Sanitizes blades daily\",\"Works on wet or dry skin\"],\"rating\":4.3,\"realityCheck\":null,\"retailer\":\"Amazon.ae\",\"reviewCount\":221,\"slug\":\"braun-series-9-pro-plus-shaver\",\"specifications\":null,\"title\":\"Braun Series 9 PRO+ Electric Shaver with SmartCare Center\",\"verdict\":\"The ultimate investment for men who want a barber-quality shave at home. Essential for UAE hygiene due to the auto-cleaning station.\",\"website\":null},\"rank\":1,\"whySelected\":\"The AI Pressure Guard Sensor prevents you from pressing too hard, solving the #1 cause of skin irritation and redness. Buy this if: you shave 5–7 days a week and hate razor burn.\"},{\"_key\":\"35d92c696f1e\",\"badgeLabel\":\"Best Luxury Shaver for Sensitive Skin\",\"customVerdict\":null,\"product\":{\"_type\":\"product\",\"address\":null,\"affiliateLink\":\"https://amzn.to/4syibOW\",\"availability\":\"https://schema.org/InStock\",\"brand\":\"Philips\",\"code\":null,\"cons\":[\"Extremely expensive\",\"\\\"Norelco\\\" branding means it's a US-style import\",\"Box includes a USB-A cable but NO wall power adapter—you must use your own phone charger plug.\"],\"country\":null,\"currency\":\"AED\",\"curriculum\":null,\"customerRating\":4.5,\"entityType\":null,\"feeRange\":null,\"heroFeature\":null,\"keyFeatures\":[\"Triple Action Lift & Cut (0.00mm closeness)\",\"SenseIQ Technology (Auto-adapts to beard density)\",\"Hydro SkinGlide coating (50% smoother glide)\",\"Includes Wireless Charging Stand & Quick Clean Pod\"],\"location\":null,\"mainImage\":{\"alt\":\"Philips Norelco i9000 Prestige box contents with shaver and cleaning pod\",\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/kxdjzy8e/production/5a66e5c259d00f0e9463f20e5c3f049fd28b5d3d-1500x1455.jpg\"},\"price\":1640,\"priceTier\":\"Premium\",\"pros\":[\"Extremely close shave for a rotary (almost blade-level)\",\"Includes the \\\"Quick Clean Pod\\\" (cleans in 1 minute)\",\"Premium \\\"Dark Slate Nova\\\" finish\",\"5-year warranty (exceptional durability)\"],\"rating\":4.5,\"realityCheck\":null,\"retailer\":\"Amazon.ae\",\"reviewCount\":2897,\"slug\":\"philips-norelco-9000-prestige\",\"specifications\":null,\"title\":\"Philips Norelco Shaver 9000 Prestige (Rechargeable Wet & Dry)\",\"verdict\":\"The absolute gold standard for rotary shavers in 2026. It cuts closer (0.00mm) than any other Philips model we've tested. If you can stomach the AED 1,600+ price tag, the inclusion of the 'Quick Clean Pod' and wireless charging stand makes it a luxury bathroom upgrade.\",\"website\":null},\"rank\":2,\"whySelected\":\"This is the 'Rolls Royce' of rotaries. We picked it because the NanoTech Dual Precision blades cut closer (0.00mm) than any standard model, while the SenseIQ Pressure Guard actively stops you from pressing too hard—solving the #1 cause of skin irritation in the UAE heat.\"},{\"_key\":\"829a0e9745b6\",\"badgeLabel\":\"Best Value for Money\",\"customVerdict\":null,\"product\":{\"_type\":\"product\",\"address\":null,\"affiliateLink\":\"https://amzn.to/3LcMObC\",\"availability\":\"https://schema.org/InStock\",\"brand\":\"Braun\",\"code\":null,\"cons\":[\"Misses some flat-lying neck hairs\",\"Basic plastic build\"],\"country\":null,\"currency\":\"AED\",\"curriculum\":null,\"customerRating\":4.3,\"entityType\"